The copy keeps the upstream layout: `repos/pstack/LICENSE` is `pstack/LICENSE` and `repos/pstack/skills/statechart/` is `pstack/skills/statechart/`. The digest covers every file in the copy: the paths in codepoint order, each followed by the sha256 of its content. The owning suite recomputes it, so a changed byte under `repos/pstack/` fails the suite until the copy is replaced by a new pinned one.

